  "title": "Никакой приставки  (No Console)",
  "level": "A1 — Duolingo Section 2",
  "labels": {
    "arkady": "Аркадий",
    "nina": "Нина",
    "samson": "Самсон"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in the communal flat, it's evening. Last time, over lunch, the governor laughed at Arkady's phone trick and told him to hand over the money; Arkady refused and walked out. Now Samson comes home with news for Nina, and Arkady comes back in a very bad mood; we'll hear it in Russian first, so don't worry about catching every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Ну что? Работа есть?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Короче, нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "С работой не получилось.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "И с Крымом тоже.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "А никто и не сомневался.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Нин, ну не начинай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Лёша, слушай меня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Никакой приставки не будет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Тебя обманули, понял?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Аркадий, ты что? Он же ребёнок.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Славик, дай сюда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Это мой айфон.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Как твой? Вы же поменялись!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Мечтай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Всё, иди отсюда!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Что это было?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Ну вот. Ни работы, ни Крыма, ни айфона.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's go back through it slowly. Nina wants to know how things went with Samson's boss.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Ну что? Работа есть?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well? Is there a job?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Короче, нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Long story short, no.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "С работой не получилось.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The job didn't work out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "И с Крымом тоже.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And the same with Crimea.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "А никто и не сомневался.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nobody ever doubted it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Нин, ну не начинай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nin, come on, don't start.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Лёша, слушай меня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lyosha, listen to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Никакой приставки не будет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There won't be any console.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Тебя обманули, понял?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You've been fooled, got it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Аркадий, ты что? Он же ребёнок.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Arkady, what's got into you? He's just a kid.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Славик, дай сюда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Slavik, give that here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Это мой айфон.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's my iPhone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Как твой?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you mean, yours?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Вы же поменялись!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You two swapped!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Мечтай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Dream on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Всё, иди отсюда!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's it, off you go!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Что это было?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What was that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Ну вот. Ни работы, ни Крыма, ни айфона.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, there you go. No job, no Crimea, and no iPhone.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
